# Original IP range
# The full supplied range is retained; it is not exclusive to WeChat.
# Migration uses the repository's no-pre-resolution contract; the original route rule did not encode no-resolve.
# QX's third-field no-resolve is a compatibility policy token, not a DNS switch; set filter_remote force-policy.
